@startuml D-交易与维权
' 民生甄选 · 子系统用例图 L3 · D 交易与维权（UC-SUB-D-01 ~ D-03）
title 民生甄选 · 子系统用例图 · D 交易与维权
left to right direction

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F4F6FB
  BorderColor #5B7DB1
}
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #EAF2FB
  BorderColor #3E6AA8
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
  BorderColor #C9B458
}

actor "消费者" as CONSUMER
actor "商户" as MERCHANT
actor "监管人员" as REGU
actor "平台运营方" as OPER

rectangle "D 交易与维权" {
  usecase "UC-SUB-D-01 提示预付卡风险" as D01
  usecase "UC-SUB-D-02 受理消费投诉并反馈进度" as D02
  usecase "UC-SUB-D-03 申诉恶意差评并识别职业索赔" as D03
}

CONSUMER --> D01
CONSUMER --> D02
MERCHANT --> D01
MERCHANT --> D02
MERCHANT --> D03
REGU --> D02
OPER --> D02
OPER --> D03

note bottom of D02
  未解决延伸升级市监办结（UC-SUB-G-03，跨模块 extend）
end note
note bottom of D03
  AI 识别辅助、人工确认后处置（C8 红线）
end note
@enduml
